    "title": "Congress.gov Notifications Congress.gov Enhancements for February of 2026",
    "link": "https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USLOC/bulletins/4064ffb",
    "summary": "<p><span>We are pleased to bring you the&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.congress.gov/help/enhancements/?loclr=eacdg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Congress.gov enhancements</a><span> for February of 2026.</span></p>\n<p><br /><em><strong>Enhancement &ndash; Senate Legislation &ndash; Actions Overview</strong></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Beginning in February 2026, the <a href=\"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/senate-resolution/519/actions/?loclr=eacdg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Actions Overview</a> on Senate simple and concurrent resolutions displays Submitted in Senate as the first action.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/senate-bill/3095/actions/?loclr=eacdg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Actions Overviews</a> on original reported measures no longer display an Introduced in Senate action.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.congress.gov/advanced-search/legislation?congresses%5B0%5D=119&amp;legislationNumbers=&amp;restrictionType=field&amp;restrictionFields%5B0%5D=allBillTitles&amp;restrictionFields%5B1%5D=summary&amp;summaryField=billSummary&amp;enterTerms=&amp;wordVariants=true&amp;legislationTypes%5B0%5D=s&amp;legislationTypes%5B1%5D=sres&amp;legislationTypes%5B2%5D=sjres&amp;legislationTypes%5B3%5D=sconres&amp;legislationTypes%5B4%5D=samdt&amp;public=true&amp;private=true&amp;chamber=all&amp;actionTerms=&amp;legislativeActionWordVariants=true&amp;actionDateBoxCount=2&amp;actionText=&amp;dateOfActionOperator=any&amp;dateOfActionStartDate=&amp;dateOfActionEndDate=&amp;dateOfActionIsOptions=yesterday&amp;actionText2=&amp;dateOfActionOperator2=any&amp;dateOfActionStartDate2=&amp;dateOfActionEndDate2=&amp;dateOfActionIsOptions2=yesterday&amp;dateOfActionToggle=multi&amp;legislativeAction=141&amp;sponsorState=One&amp;member=&amp;sponsorTypes%5B0%5D=sponsor&amp;sponsorTypes%5B1%5D=sponsor&amp;sponsorTypeBool=OR&amp;dateOfSponsorshipOperator=equal&amp;dateOfSponsorshipStartDate=&amp;dateOfSponsorshipEndDate=&amp;dateOfSponsorshipIsOpti",
